  "details": "Description\n\nhas been happening recently these days, noticed that going in avatar menu, choosing an avatar and wearing it too quickly results in the message \"this user has avatar cloning off\" ; we now have to wait the avatar to fully load (the favorite star appears at that moment) to wear it. Don’t know if intended or not, but writing this ico.\n\nReproduction Steps\n\nHave some avatars saved, try to open menu, avatars ; from there, choose another avatar to wear and tap apply immediatly (users who have the habit can go that fast) ; you’ll not wear that avatar.\n\nDetails\n\n- Category: User Interface\n\n- Frequency: Always\n\n---\n\nplatform: PC (platform: Windows, store: Steam, headset: None)\n\nrawPlatform: WindowsPlayer\n\nclientVersion: 2026.3.3-1912-2cf53b8d24-Release\n\nunityVersion: 2022.3.22f2-DWR\n\nIn-Client Report\n\n---\n\n**Log file:** [output_log_2026-09-12_21-02-28.txt](https://api.vrchat.cloud/api/1/file/file_c386a9c8-cd96-4b6a-9a5a-a93c0f2692b6/1/file)",
